bp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e45b11885ddb07afb35355c91e5d0095 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3e41cd12/uploads/origins/8dc1b605-06be-4896-93a3-1dc932e26b1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=371c231c0ec729129852df0edfde3775 3x"}, "body": "You made wonderful art for me in the past, so I have returned to once more ask you to create soemthing for me.\n\nI would like you to commission you to make a gift for a friend of mine, Tetra, of her VTuber character. \n\nSomething where she's looking down, a little yandere. Pose and outfit of your choice, you did very nicely last time!\n\nI look forward to seeing what you come up with.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FHDuXQS2ctgUedCmTYcLYEmmNZ8fpgir?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tora_kosiki/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 240058, "client_id": 2128404, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dcca6dfd/uploads/origins/b9525db6-737b-4592-95dc-06b629ca071d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6eb693208efdf8aae37253525029fbdb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dcca6dfd/uploads/origins/b9525db6-737b-4592-95dc-06b629ca071d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6eb693208efdf8aae37253525029fbdb, https://si.imgix.net/dcca6dfd/uploads/origins/b9525db6-737b-4592-95dc-06b629ca071d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=454ff46da9c975a90b1d36a386e89e5c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dcca6dfd/uploads/origins/b9525db6-737b-4592-95dc-06b629ca071d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03abce9297e09aabdf3d2ae6a652d942 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dcca6dfd/uploads/origins/b9525db6-737b-4592-95dc-06b629ca071d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6a3a0f9c9e42998fdbea285ca37ec7f9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dcca6dfd/uploads/origins/b9525db6-737b-4592-95dc-06b629ca071d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6a3a0f9c9e42998fdbea285ca37ec7f9, https://si.imgix.net/dcca6dfd/uploads/origins/b9525db6-737b-4592-95dc-06b629ca071d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4608ef51c8720989dda423bed316858d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dcca6dfd/uploads/origins/b9525db6-737b-4592-95dc-06b629ca071d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a40cccd26509b96fa5822dd5ed8757e4 3x"}, "body": "Hello, your art is super cute and would like to work together for an illustration.\n\nMy OC is a VTuber, a Milk Maiden Miko.\nShe is very dreamy and light hearted.\nThe girl loves animals, sweets, night time, forests, and videogames. \n\nHer hair is half black color and half white color.\nShe is about 163cm tall.\n\nI have a few outfits sensei can draw, if not, then the original outfit is fine. \nI'll leave the composition, pose, expression, and background to you play around with, thank you! \n\nOriginal outfit:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1QSuNXoJQG9IZt64jPt9s2r8CJ1Osu7jR/view?usp=drivesdk\n(^ this one does not have the proper half hair and ribbon colors).\n\nhttps:/drive.google.com/file/d/1nrxhdJ5ztnLN1SMwrhGwB4L_KMFaUk5I/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nNew outfit:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1QRRjtsZg3s8k90cm6erCJd4O-u134qC2/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nSexy outfit:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1QSTregXWgpheMl9zdMMKgLIhZpC9U-pr/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nThank you so much! 🙏\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1QPmXGE7ra05cd_edZFGasairHR81Tyhm/view?usp=drivesdk", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptab